{"path":"experimental/ranges/algorithm/search_n","title":"std::experimental::ranges::search_n","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::ranges::</span>search_n","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/algorithm/search_n","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Iterator to the beginning of the found sequence in the range [first, last). If no such sequence is found, an iterator that compares equal to last is returned.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/experimental/ranges/algorithm\">&lt;experimental/ranges/algorithm&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-ranges\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> ForwardIterator I, Sentinel<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> S, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Pred <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/equal_to\"><span class=\"kw2859\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">equal_to</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span>, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Proj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/identity\"><span class=\"kw2857\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">identity</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires IndirectlyComparable<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span>, Pred, Proj<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>I search_n<span class=\"br0\">(</span> I first, S last, ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difference_type_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> count,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value, Pred pred <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Pred<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, Proj proj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Proj<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-ranges-ts t-mark-ts\">(ranges TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-ranges\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> ForwardRange R, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Pred <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/equal_to\"><span class=\"kw2859\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">equal_to</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Proj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/identity\"><span class=\"kw2857\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">identity</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires IndirectlyComparable<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2908\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span>, Pred, Proj<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/iterator/dangling\"><span class=\"kw2872\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">safe_iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> search_n<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> r, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difference_type_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/iterator_t\"><span class=\"kw2908\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">iterator_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> count,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value, Pred pred <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Pred<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, Proj proj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Proj<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-ranges-ts t-mark-ts\">(ranges TS)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Searches the range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">first</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code><code>)</code></span> for the first sequence of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">count</span></code> elements whose projected values are each equal to the given value <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> according to the predicate <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pred</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Same as <span class=\"t-v\">(1)</span>, but uses <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">r</span></code> as the source range, as if using <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">first</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>r<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> first, last\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the range of elements to examine\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> r\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the range of elements to examine\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> count\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the length of the sequence to search for\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the value to search for\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> pred\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the predicate that compares the projected elements with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> proj\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> the projection to apply to the elements\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Iterator to the beginning of the found sequence in the range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">first</span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code><code>)</code></span>. If no such sequence is found, an iterator that compares equal to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last</span></code> is returned.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>At most <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">last <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> first</span></code> applications of the predicate and the projection.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>ForwardIterator I, Sentinel<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> S, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T,\n         <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Pred <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/equal_to\"><span class=\"kw2859\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">equal_to</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&gt;</span>, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Proj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/identity\"><span class=\"kw2857\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">identity</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n    requires IndirectlyComparable<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy2\">*</span>, Pred, Proj<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\nI search_n<span class=\"br0\">(</span>I first, S last, ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difference_type_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> count,\n           <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> T<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> value, Pred pred <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Pred<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span>, Proj proj <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> Proj<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> first <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> last<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>first<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw2858\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>pred, <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw2858\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>proj, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>first<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, value<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">continue</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n        I candidate <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> first<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        ranges<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">difference_type_t</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> cur_count <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n        <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>cur_count<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>cur_count <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> count<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"co1\">// success</span>\n                <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> candidate<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n            <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>first<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>first <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> last<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"co1\">// exhausted the list</span>\n                <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> first<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n            <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw2858\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>pred, <a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/functional/invoke\"><span class=\"kw2858\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">invoke</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>proj, <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>first<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, value<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n                <span class=\"co1\">// too few in a row</span>\n                <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> first<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/search_n\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>search_n</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  searches for the first occurrence of a number consecutive copies of an element in a range <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/algorithm/find_end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>find_end</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds the last sequence of elements in a certain range <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/algorithm/find\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>find</span><span>find_if</span><span>find_if_not</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds the first element satisfying specific criteria <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/experimental/ranges/algorithm/search\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>search</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  searches for a range of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/ranges","title":"Extensions for ranges"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::ranges::search_n","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Searches the range [first, last) for the first sequence of count elements whose projected values are each equal to the…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"first, last, r, count, value, pred, proj"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Iterator to the beginning of the found sequence in the range [first, last). If no such sequence is found, an iterator that compares equal to last is returned."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"At most last - first applications of the predicate and the projection."},{"label":"Possible implementation"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"search_n","note":"searches for the first occurrence of a number consecutive copies of an element in a range"},{"label":"find_end","note":"finds the last sequence of elements in a certain range"},{"label":"find, find_if, find_if_not","note":"finds the first element satisfying specific criteria"},{"label":"search","note":"searches for a range of elements"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":398,"codeBlockCount":1}
